DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddmmttmm driver provides support for the Analog Devices ADM1025, SMSC
     47m192, and Philips NE1619 temperature sensor.  The device possesses in‐
     ternal and external temperature sensors, plus a variety of voltage sen‐
     sors.  These values are made available through the sysctl(8) interface.

